{"id":1140902,"name":"탈리아·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"탈리아·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1140902]}],"trial":{"trial_id":140902,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2025-07-22 14:00:00","diary1":"당신과 탈리아는 경매장 현장에 도착했다. 이곳에는 유명 인사들이 가득했고, 당신은 점차 탈리아의 마음속 응어리를 알아차리게 되었다.\n　　뜻밖이었던 것은, 경매장에 밀수품 외에 또 다른 '깜짝선물'이 당신을 기다리고 있었다.","diary2":"경매장에서 탈리아는 오래전 잃어버렸던 가문의 문장을 보게 되었다. 그녀는 모든 것을 바쳐서라도 가문의 문장을 되찾으려 했다.\n　　카라의 압박에 못 이긴 탈리아는 결국 그녀와 협의를 맺었다. 다만 당신은 지금까지도 그녀가 무슨 생각인지 모르고 물어볼 기회도 없었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260761,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260762,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240902022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":2409020